    Player: 'VÃ¤ndtia (Swedish Shithead) is a popular Swedish shedding game. 2-4 players, 52 cards. 9 cards each: 3 face-down, 3 face-up on top, 3 in hand. Must play equal/higher rank. 2=resets pile, 10=burns pile. Four-of-a-kind clears. Must draw to 3 from stock. Endgame plays face-up then blind face-down cards.',
